    "title": "Madison Reed App - Hair Color ",
    "description": "Download the Madison Reed App today...it's like having a colorist in your pocket.\r\n\r\nCustomized Color Profile: \r\nThis is all about YOU and your #HAIRGOALS. Experience personalized product recommendations\u2014just like a colorist would give you.\r\n\r\nEasy Booking: \r\nConveniently book, reschedule or cancel appointments\u2014anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nContactless Payment: \r\nPay on the app\u2026it\u2019s that easy.\r\n\r\nTrack & Manage Orders: \r\nYour hair color, on your schedule\u2026you call the shots.\r\n\r\nAbout Madison Reed:\r\nYOUR. BEST. HAIR COLOR. EVER.\r\n \r\nExperience gorgeous, lasting, high-quality hair color\u2014at home, or at a Hair Color Bar near you.\r\n\r\nOur Smart 8-free hair color is free of ammonia, PPD, resorcinol, parabens, phthalates, gluten, SLS, and titanium dioxide. Full of hair-loving nutrients keratin, argan oil, and ginseng root extract. And as always\u2014Leaping Bunny certified, cruelty-free, no animal testing.\r\n\r\nTake the color quiz to find your perfect shade.\r\n\r\nNeed more hair color advice? Book a complimentary Video Color Consultation with one of our licensed colorists. We\u2019re here to answer all your coloring questions, from finding your perfect shade to application tips.\r\n\r\nEasily book your next Hair Color Bar appointment or find locations near you. Welcome to your most gorgeous hair color ever (seriously).",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download the Madison Reed App today...it&#39;s like having a colorist in your pocket.<br><br>Customized Color Profile: <br>This is all about YOU and your #HAIRGOALS. Experience personalized product recommendations\u2014just like a colorist would give you.<br><br>Easy Booking: <br>Conveniently book, reschedule or cancel appointments\u2014anytime, anywhere.<br><br>Contactless Payment: <br>Pay on the app\u2026it\u2019s that easy.<br><br>Track &amp; Manage Orders: <br>Your hair color, on your schedule\u2026you call the shots.<br><br>About Madison Reed:<br>YOUR. BEST. HAIR COLOR. EVER.<br> <br>Experience gorgeous, lasting, high-quality hair color\u2014at home, or at a Hair Color Bar near you.<br><br>Our Smart 8-free hair color is free of ammonia, PPD, resorcinol, parabens, phthalates, gluten, SLS, and titanium dioxide. Full of hair-loving nutrients keratin, argan oil, and ginseng root extract. And as always\u2014Leaping Bunny certified, cruelty-free, no animal testing.<br><br>Take the color quiz to find your perfect shade.<br><br>Need more hair color advice? Book a complimentary Video Color Consultation with one of our licensed colorists. We\u2019re here to answer all your coloring questions, from finding your perfect shade to application tips.<br><br>Easily book your next Hair Color Bar appointment or find locations near you. Welcome to your most gorgeous hair color ever (seriously).",
